WEBVTT

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:25.190
May, it's morning! Wake up!

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:36.870
So pretty!

00:01:04.310 --> 00:01:07.270
So, this is the last one.

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:21.910
We are still analyzing
last night's attack,

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:25.330
and no new evidence
or testimony have been collected.

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:30.210
In addition, the suspect's body was taken

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:32.540
by an unknown group.

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:36.420
They hit during transport.

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:41.220
Currently,
we have yet to find the clues we need

00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:43.010
to solve this chain of events.

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:56.480
The brain scan showed no abnormalities,

00:03:56.860 --> 00:03:58.980
-but we should be safe.
-Okay.

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:00.440
Thank you.

00:04:09.950 --> 00:04:12.460
You're okay. It's just a minor concussion.

00:04:12.710 --> 00:04:15.130
You'll be discharged
after a couple of days of rest.

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:21.050
Sorry for putting you in danger.

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:56.960
<i>Last night,</i>
<i>an automobile accident occurred</i>

00:04:57.040 --> 00:04:59.380
<i>inside a tunnel downtown.</i>

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:02.420
<i>At least a dozen trucks and vehicles</i>
<i>were involved,</i>

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:04.550
<i>some catching fire.</i>

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:09.100
<i>According to a spokesperson, injured</i>
<i>victims were taken to the hospital,</i>

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:11.600
<i>but details regarding</i>
<i>the cause of the accident...</i>

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:19.440
-What is this?
-I wonder.

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:21.610
I don't really know either.

00:05:25.110 --> 00:05:26.030
Are you alone?

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:30.030
No, I work here with my mommy and daddy.

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:32.990
-Daddy's driving right now.
-I see.

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:34.580
They must be proud.

00:05:36.210 --> 00:05:39.920
The restaurant will be in trouble
if I don't keep it together!

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:42.420
You're so dependable.

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:53.180
Don't you ever want to play?

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:56.640
I always get to play with Mommy and Daddy.

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:43.900
Tomorrow is May's birthday.

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:47.860
I can't believe she'll be 4 years old.

00:06:48.610 --> 00:06:49.780
Yes.

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:53.990
It's all thanks to Theo.

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:55.740
Because of him...

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:06.170
What's this?

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:08.630
Daddy!

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:15.390
Wow, that looks exactly like him!

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:40.210
<i>Once again,</i>

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:45.090
<i>last night, an automobile accident</i>
<i>occurred inside a tunnel downtown.</i>

00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:48.130
<i>At least a dozen trucks and vehicles</i>
<i>were involved.</i>

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:52.300
<i>The police are currently continuing their</i>
<i>investigation,</i>

00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:56.260
<i>looking into the cause of the accident</i>
<i>and other details.</i>

00:07:56.930 --> 00:07:59.890
<i>The area around the tunnel</i>
<i>is currently closed down</i>

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:03.100
<i>without any estimation</i>
<i>as to when it will be reopened.</i>

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:07.230
<i>We can anticipate severe traffic</i>
<i>to continue for the area.</i>

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:49.190
I'm glad you and Sarah made it out.

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:52.280
Sarah is resting at the hospital.

00:09:01.490 --> 00:09:04.500
There was a meeting
between the department heads this morning

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:07.750
discussing our future proceedings
regarding this case.

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:11.340
The weight of the situation

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:13.670
coupled with the lack of leads

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:16.630
has made it so nobody wants to
take any initiative.

00:09:18.390 --> 00:09:20.430
Well, that's bureaucracy for you.

00:09:21.430 --> 00:09:26.100
Just because we don't know the truth,
they're just going to stay quiet and wait?

00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:28.190
Be a little reasonable.

00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:30.480
Grimm was actually alive,

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:32.940
but his body was taken?

00:09:33.280 --> 00:09:35.570
Nobody's going to want to touch that.

00:09:36.030 --> 00:09:37.570
That's not a good reason!

00:09:37.860 --> 00:09:41.200
We're taking actions to avoid causing
needless confusion.

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:44.080
That's what Richard
and the top brass decided.

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:45.790
But at this rate...

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:50.750
At this rate, the investigation will grind
to a halt?

00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:53.590
That's certainly a possibility.

00:09:54.090 --> 00:09:56.550
-But this case is--
-I'm aware.

00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:03.850
The SSC
takes action to seek out the truth.

00:10:11.270 --> 00:10:13.110
Luckily, we have you.

00:10:14.570 --> 00:10:17.990
You were there and saw everything.

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:49.230
Come on! This way!

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:15.880
"The body was buried in a public cemetery,
as it was left unclaimed."

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:36.320
I talked to Eddy about Grimm.

00:11:36.690 --> 00:11:38.280
How was he?

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:40.900
Understandably surprised.

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:46.490
But he accepted it pretty quickly.

00:11:47.490 --> 00:11:49.290
That man's adaptable.

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:52.580
So, I'm having him look into Grimm.

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:56.670
I know Eddy will find something.

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:06.260
What about the Mask?

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:10.850
Honestly, that's something
I haven't come to terms with yet.

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:15.230
Without having the actual object,
there's no way it can be explained.

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:19.190
The only ones who know the Mask exists
are you and me.

00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:20.690
And also Sarah.

00:12:45.220 --> 00:12:46.090
<i>The sample?</i>

00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:48.260
Not here.

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:50.470
Only our dead men.

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:53.850
<i>I see. They'll have to be recovered.</i>

00:12:55.560 --> 00:12:56.730
<i>You continue--</i>

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:26.380
Damn it, who the hell were those guys?

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:13.310
-That's so pretty.
-Right?

00:14:25.110 --> 00:14:26.690
<i>The bodies are all our men.</i>

00:14:27.400 --> 00:14:30.320
<i>There's no sign of the test subject having</i>
<i>undergone rapid aging.</i>

00:14:33.530 --> 00:14:34.370
Rapid aging?

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:00.400
God, this is creepy.

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:11.780
What are these?

00:15:13.490 --> 00:15:14.330
Isolation cells?

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:22.380
Grimm.

00:15:39.270 --> 00:15:40.100
Death in prison.

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:45.440
It's not just Grimm.

00:16:45.290 --> 00:16:46.920
Mommy is busy!

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:50.250
<i>Hello?</i>

00:17:12.940 --> 00:17:15.450
<i>Hello? Who's there?</i>

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:23.160
<i>It's me. There's a few things I found out</i>
<i>about Grimm.</i>

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:27.960
<i>Sorry, I'll forward them over now.</i>

00:17:28.420 --> 00:17:30.290
Okay, I'll head back to my desk.

00:17:43.310 --> 00:17:44.640
We laid him down inside.

00:17:58.030 --> 00:17:59.320
The prison holding Grimm...

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:01.830
had already been shut down.

00:18:02.240 --> 00:18:05.830
<i>The other prisoners were transferred to</i>
<i>other facilities.</i>

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:09.830
<i>According to the record,</i>
<i>Grimm died shortly before that.</i>

00:18:10.590 --> 00:18:14.510
But there's one thing I found after
going to the prison myself.

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:17.840
<i>In addition to Grimm,</i>

00:18:18.220 --> 00:18:21.100
there were several other prisoners
who died in prison.

00:18:22.680 --> 00:18:23.930
Grimm was alive.

00:18:24.720 --> 00:18:26.390
So, they could be, too.

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:31.360
<i>If we're able to find them,</i>

00:18:31.650 --> 00:18:34.030
<i>I think it'll help us learn something</i>
<i>about Grimm.</i>

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:39.280
I'm connecting with you now.

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:43.160
I'd like to link this with the cameras
around the city.

00:18:43.240 --> 00:18:44.160
Is that okay?

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:46.700
-You're going to run a search?
-<i>Yeah.</i>

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:50.170
<i>It might turn up nothing, but then again,</i>
<i>we might get a hit.</i>

00:18:52.920 --> 00:18:53.920
Is that a go?

00:18:57.880 --> 00:18:58.720
Okay.

00:19:11.270 --> 00:19:13.520
Eddy, go ahead whenever you're ready.

00:19:37.590 --> 00:19:38.420
<i>Last night,</i>

00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:41.720
<i>a multiple-vehicle collision occurred</i>

00:19:41.930 --> 00:19:43.590
<i>inside a highway tunnel.</i>

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:45.640
<i>Mommy is busy.</i>

00:19:46.100 --> 00:19:47.310
<i>--have been hospitalized.</i>

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:49.930
I just want to see her. Even for a second.

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:02.700
<i>According to a spokesperson,</i>

00:20:02.780 --> 00:20:05.320
<i>injured victims</i>
<i>were taken to the hospital,</i>

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:08.740
<i>but details regarding the cause of</i>
<i>the accident are being investigated.</i>

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:11.830
<i>The area around the tunnel</i>
<i>is currently closed down.</i>

00:20:11.910 --> 00:20:14.250
<i>We can anticipate severe traffic</i>
<i>to continue.</i>

00:20:33.690 --> 00:20:34.520
Theo?

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:37.230
-Theo Lowe?
-Theo?

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:44.200
That's nearby.

00:20:44.780 --> 00:20:45.910
I'm on my way, too!

00:21:07.890 --> 00:21:08.890
I knew he'd come.

00:21:18.440 --> 00:21:21.320
Target confirmed.
Secure immediately after impact.

00:22:45.650 --> 00:22:46.530
Did he just...

00:22:48.650 --> 00:22:49.570
dodge a bullet?

00:24:19.450 --> 00:24:21.960
Subtitle translation by Zensho Yamamoto
